{"id":8860456353991,"title":"Personalized Black Hair Reading Girl with Bookshelf Throw Blanket","handle":"personalized-black-hair-reading-girl-with-bookshelf-throw-blanket","description":"\u003cp\u003eWrap yourself in comfort with our personalized book blanket, designed for every book lover. This unique throw is a thoughtful and special way to celebrate a passion for reading, perfect for cozying up with your favorite stories or as a decorative touch in your reading nook.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A thoughtful and personal gift that any book lover will cherish, perfect for showing off their love of reading.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Make it truly special by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name, creating a one-of-a-kind blanket.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ideal for book lovers on special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort and Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that adds warmth and style to any book lover’s reading nook.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from soft and durable polyester, offering lightweight warmth.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This blanket is machine washable for convenient cleaning.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003